WEBVTT

01:30.400 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:50.320 --> 01:51.160
Yan.

01:53.200 --> 01:54.320
Are you upset?

01:58.000 --> 01:59.120
I'm upset too.

02:02.960 --> 02:05.680
Tomorrow is Qingyang's birthday feast.

02:05.760 --> 02:08.199
The kitchen has prepared
a lot of fine wine for the feast.

02:10.880 --> 02:13.760
I stole two pots out.
Do you want to drink?

02:18.880 --> 02:19.920
Thank you.

02:47.760 --> 02:48.880
I don't have parents.

02:49.600 --> 02:52.080
I've never celebrated a birthday.
How about you?

02:54.800 --> 02:55.760
I have parents,

02:56.760 --> 02:57.800
but I've never celebrated
a birthday either.

03:00.520 --> 03:02.640
I heard your story from He Zhou.

03:04.520 --> 03:05.520
Zhao Ming said

03:05.600 --> 03:09.160
some people are destined
to never prioritize love.

03:11.040 --> 03:14.640
But I believe love cannot be hidden.

03:16.880 --> 03:20.880
Yan, when you recall
Qingyang's feelings for you,

03:20.960 --> 03:21.880
were they real?

03:22.960 --> 03:25.920
Could it be that she was lying
about the last words she said to you?

03:26.000 --> 03:27.400
Have you thought about asking her again?

03:29.880 --> 03:31.000
You really have a lot of questions.

03:33.560 --> 03:35.280
But can't you answer one of them?

03:51.360 --> 03:52.720
I'm going to find Zhao Ming.

03:53.360 --> 03:54.840
He always has many answers for me.

03:58.640 --> 03:59.480
Wine can heal wounds.

04:10.160 --> 04:11.840
You… Don't waste it.

04:19.200 --> 04:22.440
GRACEFUL PALACE

05:43.080 --> 05:44.560
You've been drinking.

05:44.640 --> 05:45.800
You once said

05:48.040 --> 05:49.680
you've only ever used me,

05:52.120 --> 05:53.840
that you never loved me.

05:56.560 --> 05:57.880
Was that true?

06:09.840 --> 06:10.840
It was true.

06:12.440 --> 06:14.320
I'll ask you one last time.

06:17.920 --> 06:19.640
Can you stop lying to me?

06:22.320 --> 06:24.320
If you're willing to tell the truth,

06:25.200 --> 06:26.440
I'll help you.

06:40.360 --> 06:42.120
No matter how many times you ask,

06:43.800 --> 06:45.360
my answer will always be the same.

06:47.880 --> 06:49.800
You are just my knife,

06:51.880 --> 06:54.360
a tool that makes my life better.

06:55.760 --> 06:58.640
Of course, I still need you now.

07:00.520 --> 07:02.240
If you're willing to help me,

07:03.920 --> 07:05.840
I can keep pretending to like you.

07:05.920 --> 07:08.520
Even after marrying Zhao Ming,

07:08.600 --> 07:09.880
-I can still continue--
-Enough!

07:19.840 --> 07:21.240
You're truly heartless.

08:11.160 --> 08:13.280
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

08:13.360 --> 08:14.240
Have you been drinking?

08:15.960 --> 08:16.920
Yes.

08:17.520 --> 08:21.040
I've drunk such a big jar of wine…

08:26.080 --> 08:28.360
-How did you get hurt?
-I fell.

08:33.600 --> 08:35.000
How did you fall so badly?

08:35.600 --> 08:37.240
Because I'm a pearl…

08:42.080 --> 08:44.400
Pearls roll easily!

09:01.720 --> 09:03.240
This is a gift

09:03.320 --> 09:05.840
I prepared for a long time.

09:06.560 --> 09:09.920
The material is from the prize
you helped me win.

09:11.200 --> 09:14.720
Inside, I've engraved "Zhao Ming".

09:16.360 --> 09:17.600
I didn't plan to give it to you,

09:19.240 --> 09:21.320
but after thinking about it,

09:24.240 --> 09:25.640
I decided to give it to you

09:28.360 --> 09:29.640
to congratulate you and Qingyang.

09:44.880 --> 09:46.760
He Zhou said you've made a noise lately,

09:47.440 --> 09:49.040
as if you're working on something.

09:49.640 --> 09:50.680
Turns out you were making this.

09:54.680 --> 09:55.560
Do you like it?

10:01.200 --> 10:02.080
I like it.

10:06.800 --> 10:07.960
I'm glad you like it.

10:18.520 --> 10:19.520
Pearl,

10:21.520 --> 10:24.800
don't drink so much wine again, okay?

10:32.240 --> 10:34.080
But if I hadn't drunk so much,

10:35.360 --> 10:37.280
I wouldn't have the courage
to give this gift to you.

10:41.880 --> 10:42.920
What's this?

10:44.440 --> 10:45.520
This?

10:49.040 --> 10:50.520
This is…

10:51.400 --> 10:53.160
a popular tattoo style recently.

10:56.400 --> 10:57.240
Does it look good?

11:00.800 --> 11:01.680
You're drunk.

11:02.720 --> 11:03.800
I'll take you back.

11:15.440 --> 11:16.280
Are you cold?

11:20.160 --> 11:21.560
If you're cold, just hold on tighter.

11:27.760 --> 11:31.640
How I wish this journey
could be a little longer.

11:33.000 --> 11:36.360
Zhao Ming, in the years to come,

11:36.440 --> 11:39.000
I wish all your dreams come true,

11:39.520 --> 11:40.840
and may you live in happiness and peace.

11:45.640 --> 11:46.480
Thank you, Your Majesty,

11:46.560 --> 11:48.800
for hosting this birthday feast
for my daughter.

11:49.320 --> 11:51.080
I offer a cup to Your Majesty.

11:51.840 --> 11:52.760
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

11:52.840 --> 11:54.200
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

12:00.080 --> 12:02.200
I would like to offer
a dance to Your Majesty

12:02.280 --> 12:03.280
as a token of respect.

12:03.360 --> 12:04.880
My daughter has practiced dancing
since childhood.

12:04.960 --> 12:09.120
Her dancing skills are well-known
in our Xilin Kingdom.

12:09.720 --> 12:10.720
I'm looking forward to it.

12:53.600 --> 12:55.400
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

13:08.840 --> 13:11.080
-Nice!
-Very nice…

13:33.640 --> 13:35.160
-Alert!
-Assassin!

13:39.560 --> 13:40.800
Qingyang, what are you doing?

13:40.880 --> 13:42.040
Kneel! Kneel!

13:45.920 --> 13:47.880
Princess Qingyang
dares to murder His Majesty!

13:47.960 --> 13:48.880
Truly an act of rebellion!

13:48.960 --> 13:50.520
An unforgivable crime!

13:50.600 --> 13:51.960
The King of Xilin
cannot escape his punishment.

13:52.040 --> 13:53.280
The whole family is to be executed!

13:54.080 --> 13:57.680
The second bet
is that human nature is changeable.

13:57.760 --> 13:59.400
Even family and friends can betray you.

13:59.480 --> 14:00.440
This matter has nothing to do with me.

14:00.520 --> 14:02.200
Please, Your Majesty, see it clearly!

14:04.920 --> 14:06.640
-Take them away.
-Yes!

14:07.920 --> 14:08.760
Move!

14:10.240 --> 14:12.920
Zhao Ming, you can't kill me.

14:13.000 --> 14:14.680
I am the king of Xilin!

14:14.760 --> 14:16.320
Behind me,

14:16.400 --> 14:19.040
there are tens of thousands
of Xilin soldiers waiting for my return!

14:21.360 --> 14:24.280
The King of Xilin and the princess
conspired to murder me.

14:24.360 --> 14:26.080
In front of everyone,
there is no denying it.

14:26.720 --> 14:30.320
Legally and morally,
I have the right to kill you.

14:31.080 --> 14:33.080
The people have their sense of justice.

14:33.160 --> 14:34.560
The war has just ended.

14:34.640 --> 14:36.440
I believe the soldiers of Xilin

14:37.440 --> 14:39.840
will not risk another war with Dongze

14:40.440 --> 14:41.800
for such a vile king.

14:41.880 --> 14:43.480
-Take them away!
-Yes!

14:43.560 --> 14:44.760
-Yes!
-You…

14:44.840 --> 14:46.160
-Behave yourself!
-Move!

14:46.240 --> 14:47.200
-Zhao Ming!
-Move!

14:48.000 --> 14:49.040
You can't kill me!

14:49.880 --> 14:51.480
Oh… Are you okay?

14:52.240 --> 14:53.080
I'm fine.

14:53.160 --> 14:55.400
Do you think the King of Xilin
has gone mad?

14:55.480 --> 14:56.920
-His courage is too great.
-Yeah.

14:57.000 --> 14:58.840
How will His Majesty deal with them?

14:58.920 --> 15:00.600
What crime is it to murder an emperor?

15:00.680 --> 15:01.760
You should know better than I do.

15:01.840 --> 15:03.480
But there's one thing,

15:04.000 --> 15:06.200
perhaps, you should take a look at.

15:10.200 --> 15:13.760
EVERJOY PALACE

15:30.960 --> 15:32.920
You shouldn't get used to all this.

15:44.400 --> 15:45.880
You're truly heartless.

15:51.160 --> 15:52.880
This ruined life

15:54.040 --> 15:55.240
has come to this point.

15:57.800 --> 15:58.840
It's enough.

16:01.200 --> 16:04.360
You once said you've only ever used me,

16:05.600 --> 16:07.280
that you never loved me.

16:09.000 --> 16:10.440
Was that true?

16:14.000 --> 16:15.600
I'll ask you one last time.

16:17.120 --> 16:18.880
I'll ask you one last time!

16:21.440 --> 16:23.200
Can you stop lying to me?

16:53.400 --> 16:55.160
-What are you doing here?
-Leave!

16:57.360 --> 16:58.560
I won't leave!

16:59.480 --> 17:01.160
You still won't tell the truth,

17:02.520 --> 17:03.720
will you?

17:03.800 --> 17:06.800
You risked being burned alive
just to ask me these questions?

17:06.880 --> 17:08.680
When did you become so crazy?

17:08.760 --> 17:11.200
To deal with someone like you,
of course, I must use crazy methods.

17:11.280 --> 17:13.160
Is the answer really that important?

17:16.400 --> 17:17.280
Yes.

17:20.480 --> 17:23.720
I've told you that no matter when,

17:23.800 --> 17:25.319
the answer is always the same.

17:26.480 --> 17:28.800
Leave. Leave!

17:29.760 --> 17:31.680
You're not even afraid of death,

17:31.760 --> 17:34.400
yet you use a better life as an excuse
and push me away.

17:35.520 --> 17:37.120
Do you think I'll believe that?

17:39.080 --> 17:41.000
I was using you the whole time.

17:41.080 --> 17:42.480
Stop imagining things!

17:43.720 --> 17:45.760
I just saw the fragment
of the Celestial Ladder.

17:49.400 --> 17:51.440
That's the treasure of Nanyuan.

17:53.840 --> 17:56.160
So, you hid it back then,

17:57.120 --> 17:58.160
didn't you?

18:04.760 --> 18:06.080
You're right.

18:07.200 --> 18:08.760
I'm just a fool.

18:09.360 --> 18:12.440
I couldn't see everything you did.
Every word you said was a lie.

18:13.040 --> 18:14.760
You meant to push me away.

18:15.480 --> 18:18.680
You wanted me to give up because you know

18:20.160 --> 18:22.440
as long as the King of Xilin is alive,

18:23.640 --> 18:26.080
he will never truly set you free.

18:27.000 --> 18:29.840
He will keep using you to control me,

18:30.360 --> 18:31.720
until I die.

18:33.000 --> 18:34.040
Right?

18:37.760 --> 18:40.440
Does asking these questions matter now?

18:41.720 --> 18:43.400
In this situation today,

18:44.360 --> 18:45.800
Qingyang must die.

18:45.880 --> 18:47.520
Then I'll die with you.

18:49.120 --> 18:50.400
I don't need that.

18:56.520 --> 18:58.240
This is my vow.

19:02.960 --> 19:06.920
Yan will always protect the princess.

19:09.520 --> 19:12.240
This was the vow I made in my heart.

19:14.640 --> 19:18.520
In the years I left Xilin, I broke my vow.

19:21.560 --> 19:22.760
But today,

19:24.720 --> 19:26.040
I won't leave.

19:45.080 --> 19:45.960
I believe you.

19:49.400 --> 19:50.360
I believe you.

19:53.240 --> 19:54.200
I believe you.

19:55.800 --> 19:56.800
I believe you!

20:36.480 --> 20:39.280
Is the situation resolved?

20:39.800 --> 20:41.000
From today on,

20:42.360 --> 20:44.480
there will be no more
Qingyang and Yan in this world.

20:46.360 --> 20:48.760
Death, is it fortunate?

20:52.680 --> 20:53.920
Sometimes it is.

20:59.960 --> 21:03.280
Has Fate mentioned
where the divine child is?

21:04.760 --> 21:05.720
Well…

21:06.880 --> 21:07.720
He hasn't.

21:10.840 --> 21:12.680
Since Fate does not answer,

21:13.520 --> 21:15.920
I no longer wish to wait!

21:17.000 --> 21:19.520
Now, go to all the water sources
in the human realm,

21:19.600 --> 21:21.680
whether by poisoning or emptying them,

21:21.760 --> 21:24.360
bring forth a dry spell as a punishment!

21:25.960 --> 21:27.880
And inform the humans

21:28.480 --> 21:32.200
that the source of the disaster
lies with Zhao Ming,

21:33.160 --> 21:34.760
and to end the disaster,

21:35.440 --> 21:39.360
a sacrifice of young boys and girls
must be made!

21:39.960 --> 21:40.800
-Understood.
-Understood.

21:42.080 --> 21:43.960
The area affected by this dry spell

21:44.040 --> 21:45.360
and the duration of it

21:45.440 --> 21:47.400
hasn't been seen or heard of
in nearly a hundred years!

21:48.080 --> 21:49.160
Dongze is filled with starving people.

21:49.240 --> 21:50.720
They've even resorted to man-eating.

21:50.800 --> 21:52.680
The nobles
collectively request Your Majesty

21:52.760 --> 21:55.600
to follow the divine edict
and sacrifice 3,000 young boys and girls.

21:55.680 --> 21:57.640
Please, Your Majesty,
follow the divine edict

21:57.720 --> 22:00.240
and sacrifice 3,000 young boys and girls!

22:00.960 --> 22:02.880
-He is a foolish ruler!
-A disaster!

22:02.960 --> 22:04.360
-A disaster!
-It's all his fault!

22:04.440 --> 22:06.240
-Kill him!
-He's not fit to be a wise ruler!

22:06.320 --> 22:07.480
Kill him!

22:07.560 --> 22:09.120
He's not even human!

22:09.200 --> 22:10.440
He doesn't want us to have peace!

22:10.520 --> 22:11.440
A beast!

22:28.840 --> 22:30.000
When the war ended,

22:30.920 --> 22:33.840
the army returned to the city,
the people cheered along the way.

22:33.920 --> 22:35.600
How little time has passed,

22:37.440 --> 22:38.520
and yet things have turned out this way.

22:39.120 --> 22:41.520
They probably forgot
who was protecting them all along.

22:45.120 --> 22:49.840
May the deities bless us.

22:49.920 --> 22:50.800
Please forgive them.

22:52.560 --> 22:53.520
May the deities bless us.

22:53.600 --> 22:55.440
May the deities bless us.

22:57.280 --> 22:58.720
Bless us…

23:05.040 --> 23:06.480
What are you doing?
This is for the deities!

23:13.920 --> 23:15.440
That chicken is mine.

23:15.520 --> 23:17.160
That duck is mine.

23:17.240 --> 23:18.440
I'm so hungry.

23:18.520 --> 23:19.960
Me too.

23:25.120 --> 23:27.000
Guarding these dead things,

23:29.160 --> 23:30.600
yet treating human life like dirt.

23:30.680 --> 23:31.800
What dead things?

23:31.880 --> 23:33.320
This is great disrespect to the deities!
Get away from here!

23:33.400 --> 23:34.480
Who do you think you're talking to?

23:34.560 --> 23:35.400
I don't care who you are.

23:35.480 --> 23:37.000
The deities are the highest in this world!

23:38.160 --> 23:39.440
-Exactly.
-They're causing trouble here.

23:39.520 --> 23:40.640
-Exactly.
-Exactly.

23:40.720 --> 23:42.280
They're dishonoring the deities…

23:43.320 --> 23:45.240
Stop that! The deities will punish us!

23:45.320 --> 23:46.840
-What are you doing?
-What is he doing?

23:46.920 --> 23:48.720
-What is he doing?
-This is unacceptable!

23:48.800 --> 23:51.400
-He can't do that!
-Stop him.

23:52.000 --> 23:54.000
-Holy god!
-This will anger the deities!

23:54.080 --> 23:55.840
-You can't do this.
-No…

23:55.920 --> 24:00.720
-The deities will punish us!
-We will be punished.

24:00.800 --> 24:02.440
-It's not allowed!
-We can't do this.

24:02.520 --> 24:04.640
-It's not allowed!
-It's not allowed!

24:04.720 --> 24:07.160
-Why?
-The deities will punish us.

24:07.240 --> 24:08.600
The deities will bring down their wrath.

24:16.600 --> 24:17.920
You're Saint Emperor Zhao Ming!

24:19.600 --> 24:22.280
Your Majesty, spare us!

24:25.800 --> 24:27.520
Dongze forbids sacrifices.

24:28.440 --> 24:30.440
You can't even feed
your parents and children,

24:31.200 --> 24:32.440
yet you still sacrifice to the deities!

24:33.600 --> 24:37.120
-The deities will punish us!
-Spare us…

24:37.200 --> 24:38.760
Please spare us!

24:39.680 --> 24:41.640
May the deities forgive us…

25:36.520 --> 25:38.080
You have a lot of nerve,

25:40.160 --> 25:42.200
daring to secretly capture
young boys and girls.

25:42.960 --> 25:43.960
Your Majesty, spare us.

25:44.040 --> 25:45.720
We were just following orders.

25:45.800 --> 25:48.520
The act of capturing young boys and girls
started in many villages long ago.

25:48.600 --> 25:50.920
It was not just here.
The law doesn't punish the masses.

25:51.000 --> 25:52.400
Please, Your Majesty, spare us!

25:53.760 --> 25:56.000
He Zhou, gather 3,000 young boys and girls

25:56.600 --> 25:58.280
-and bring them to the palace immediately.
-Yes!

26:01.760 --> 26:03.440
You're bringing
the young boys and girls to the palace

26:03.520 --> 26:06.280
to protect them, right?

26:06.360 --> 26:07.880
Only then

26:09.280 --> 26:11.800
will they not be captured
by others for sacrifice.

26:18.080 --> 26:20.800
Your people have made you sad.

26:22.800 --> 26:23.800
Are you angry with them?

26:29.360 --> 26:30.520
They were just scared.

26:31.160 --> 26:33.520
The humans have no divine channels,
except for me.

26:33.600 --> 26:34.680
They can't cultivate.

26:36.040 --> 26:38.080
Facing a disaster
far beyond their own strength,

26:38.160 --> 26:39.560
they will be fearful,

26:40.240 --> 26:42.920
confused, complain,

26:43.600 --> 26:44.840
and even do wrong things.

26:45.640 --> 26:47.160
I admit, I have been disappointed,

26:48.680 --> 26:50.120
but I will not give up.

26:52.120 --> 26:53.200
I know

26:53.280 --> 26:56.480
what you see is not
just about one person or one thing,

26:57.080 --> 26:59.560
it's about the whole world
and all affairs.

27:01.400 --> 27:03.160
I remember you once told me

27:03.760 --> 27:06.400
that people are simple, yet also complex.

27:07.160 --> 27:10.080
They're weak,
yet they can also have strength.

27:12.920 --> 27:15.960
There's one thing I've never told you.

27:16.840 --> 27:18.040
Actually,

27:19.040 --> 27:21.080
I already know I'm the Chaos Pearl.

27:22.360 --> 27:23.400
When did you find out?

27:24.160 --> 27:25.080
But…

27:25.600 --> 27:27.680
I want to stay by your side as Pearl.

27:30.920 --> 27:33.160
Do you know why I came to the human realm?

27:41.480 --> 27:43.440
The Chaos Pearl is kind and merciful,

27:43.520 --> 27:45.640
unwilling to see
the suffering of the people.

27:46.160 --> 27:47.600
So, it sacrifices itself
to mend the heavens.

27:54.880 --> 27:58.240
Mending the heavens was Hao Tian's order.

27:58.920 --> 28:00.960
Although I can't recall
things from the past,

28:01.040 --> 28:03.800
I faintly remember
that Hao Tian once told me

28:04.320 --> 28:06.000
that the existence
of me and the Book of Fate

28:06.080 --> 28:09.520
was only to maintain
the order and operation of the world.

28:10.040 --> 28:14.200
As for the life journey of all beings,
and the rise and fall of fortunes,

28:14.280 --> 28:15.920
it has nothing to do with us.

28:17.640 --> 28:20.360
My connection with this world is you.

28:21.840 --> 28:24.720
You taught me what it means to be human,

28:25.480 --> 28:26.720
what love is,

28:27.680 --> 28:29.400
what it means to protect.

28:32.200 --> 28:36.440
Once the young boys and girls arrive,
I will protect them with you.

28:36.520 --> 28:38.120
Just like you said…

28:43.600 --> 28:44.600
that's the resolve to protect.

28:51.720 --> 28:53.960
He Zhou, we found
a few new divine servants,

28:54.040 --> 28:56.480
four boys and two girls,
all born in the year of Cang Hao.

28:58.360 --> 28:59.240
Come with me.

28:59.320 --> 29:00.440
My mother said

29:00.520 --> 29:03.240
once you ascend to the heavens,
you can never return home.

29:03.320 --> 29:04.640
What's there to be sad about?

29:04.720 --> 29:06.600
To be chosen as a divine servant
is a family's honor.

29:06.680 --> 29:07.760
That's a good thing.

29:07.840 --> 29:09.520
Becoming a divine servant
means being sacrificed.

29:09.600 --> 29:11.040
We will die!

29:11.120 --> 29:13.280
Don't talk nonsense. That's not death.

29:13.360 --> 29:14.840
It's just leaving this mortal body

29:14.920 --> 29:17.200
and going to the Celestial Realm
to serve the deities.

29:17.280 --> 29:20.160
His Majesty has given orders
to take good care of these children.

29:20.240 --> 29:21.080
Understood.

29:21.160 --> 29:22.680
FORTUNE RESIDENCE

29:26.120 --> 29:28.760
Does His Majesty want us to die?

29:30.480 --> 29:31.760
Don't misunderstand him, dear.

29:32.840 --> 29:34.800
His Majesty was born
to be favored by the heavens.

29:34.880 --> 29:37.000
He should never be tainted
by the mortal world.

29:37.760 --> 29:39.400
But I have been by his side
for over ten years.

29:39.480 --> 29:42.920
I have seen him work tirelessly every day
for ordinary people like you and me.

29:43.680 --> 29:46.560
Hasn't your village
received his protection

29:46.640 --> 29:47.560
and blessings?

29:48.720 --> 29:51.760
Even the Saint Emperor
has his difficulties,

29:51.840 --> 29:53.440
but we must trust him.

29:53.520 --> 29:55.360
He will give us the best of the world.

29:57.440 --> 29:58.720
Your Grace, you summoned me.

29:58.800 --> 30:00.040
What's it for?

30:00.120 --> 30:02.240
I want you to help the Emperor Zhao Ming

30:02.320 --> 30:04.760
become the strongest in the world.

30:05.800 --> 30:07.880
Zhao Ming intends to slay the deities.

30:07.960 --> 30:10.200
Helping him is like destroying
the Celestial Realm.

30:10.280 --> 30:13.600
Now, the two realms are in chaos,
the divine artifact falls in love,

30:13.680 --> 30:16.600
the four seasons are out of order,
and disasters are widespread.

30:16.680 --> 30:20.400
Relying solely on you to act on my laws
is not enough.

30:20.480 --> 30:24.040
Only the strongest in the world
can be my vessel

30:24.120 --> 30:25.760
and help me descend.

30:25.840 --> 30:27.080
Your Grace,

30:27.600 --> 30:30.200
you actually decide
to personally correct the errors

30:30.280 --> 30:31.440
and save the world?

30:31.520 --> 30:34.960
Rather than fixing the mistakes,
it's better to start over.

30:36.280 --> 30:37.520
What does starting over mean?

30:38.240 --> 30:42.080
When the time comes, you will know.

30:42.160 --> 30:43.440
Off you go.

30:52.480 --> 30:53.960
Your Majesty, the advisor has returned.

31:07.200 --> 31:09.000
You have been away for days.

31:09.080 --> 31:10.200
Are you returning

31:11.040 --> 31:14.160
because you're concerned about the palace
and the people here?

31:15.760 --> 31:19.040
What I'm concerned about is your will.

31:22.880 --> 31:23.840
The Jun Tian Sword…

31:25.840 --> 31:27.320
Your Majesty, you were born
with divine channels

31:28.000 --> 31:29.160
and also own the sovereign fortune.

31:29.240 --> 31:31.480
If the Jun Tian Sword
can acknowledge you as its master,

31:32.000 --> 31:33.520
you could fight against the Divine Clan.

31:34.040 --> 31:35.520
I've figured out
the Jun Tian Swordsmanship

31:36.160 --> 31:37.360
and even visited
the entrance to the Guixu.

31:37.440 --> 31:38.680
However,

31:39.560 --> 31:41.600
I can only sense a strong sword energy,

31:42.560 --> 31:43.960
but cannot make the Jun Tian Sword appear.

31:49.680 --> 31:53.280
During my time away,
I searched for ancient texts

31:54.240 --> 31:55.280
and found a record.

31:56.480 --> 31:59.320
The Jun Tian Sword originates
from the primal chaos energy.

32:00.360 --> 32:03.440
To draw it out of its sheath,
we need to use killing aura as bait.

32:04.680 --> 32:05.600
Using killing aura as bait?

32:06.280 --> 32:09.160
Your Majesty, you can use
human blood as a sacrifice.

32:09.960 --> 32:11.240
Other's blood

32:11.920 --> 32:13.120
or your own will work.

32:16.200 --> 32:17.280
Thank you for your guidance.

32:25.360 --> 32:28.480
Since you've returned, will you stay?

32:28.560 --> 32:29.520
No.

32:30.200 --> 32:31.320
By fate,

32:33.640 --> 32:34.880
I will meet with Your Majesty again.

32:37.320 --> 32:40.360
GRACEFUL PALACE

32:44.080 --> 32:46.880
ZHAO MING

33:21.840 --> 33:24.360
Pearl, I will leave the palace
for a few days.

33:24.960 --> 33:26.000
What are you going to do?

33:26.080 --> 33:27.440
Retrieve the sword from the Guixu.

33:27.520 --> 33:28.720
When will you depart?

33:35.360 --> 33:37.600
Today. Right now.

33:37.680 --> 33:39.360
-I will go with you!
-No,

33:39.440 --> 33:40.520
I will go alone.

33:40.600 --> 33:42.120
The Guixu is dangerous.

33:42.200 --> 33:44.400
How can Your Majesty go alone?
I will accompany you.

33:44.480 --> 33:45.560
My mind is made up.

33:45.640 --> 33:47.800
-But Your Majesty--
-You should stay in the palace,

33:48.560 --> 33:50.920
protect the children well,
and make sure nothing happens to them.

33:52.160 --> 33:53.000
Alright.

33:54.800 --> 33:55.800
I will stay in the palace,

33:56.680 --> 33:59.920
behind you, waiting for your return.

34:18.760 --> 34:19.920
Take good care of yourself.

34:20.800 --> 34:23.920
In ten days, I will return.

34:30.760 --> 34:32.639
Go ahead and do what you need to do.

34:33.679 --> 34:35.639
I will do my best to protect here.

34:37.639 --> 34:38.480
I trust you.

34:40.040 --> 34:40.880
I trust you too.

34:49.080 --> 34:50.159
I'm leaving now.

35:02.760 --> 35:05.800
A FEW DAYS LATER

35:07.840 --> 35:09.080
You've almost worn out this book.

35:10.080 --> 35:11.400
What are you looking for?

35:12.440 --> 35:14.560
Since I am transformed
from the Chaos Pearl,

35:14.640 --> 35:16.000
how could I have no Chaos Power?

35:17.080 --> 35:19.720
When you first took form,
we were also puzzled.

35:20.280 --> 35:21.440
His Majesty guessed

35:21.520 --> 35:23.840
that your spiritual power was exhausted
when you mended the heavens.

35:24.760 --> 35:27.080
Although he gave you one soul,

35:27.160 --> 35:29.960
it was still too weak
for an ancient artifact.

35:31.720 --> 35:35.000
Is there no way to quickly recover it?

35:35.080 --> 35:36.360
The matter of the divine artifact

35:36.440 --> 35:37.960
is even more mysterious
than that of the Divine Clan.

35:38.040 --> 35:39.520
Don't worry too much.

35:41.040 --> 35:42.440
The palace has increased its defenses.

35:42.520 --> 35:43.600
I'll go check things out now.

35:47.440 --> 35:48.480
Pearl,

35:49.640 --> 35:52.680
you seem a bit different now.

35:52.760 --> 35:54.000
Different?

35:55.080 --> 35:57.720
You seem to be more and more
like His Majesty.

36:01.840 --> 36:03.520
But don't learn from him
to work without rest.

36:03.600 --> 36:06.480
His Majesty is not here,
so you must take care of yourself.

36:22.000 --> 36:24.880
By what means could I help Zhao Ming?

36:25.920 --> 36:27.880
If I can recover all the memories,

36:28.640 --> 36:30.920
will that restore my Chaos Power?

36:58.760 --> 36:59.960
Yan.

37:00.040 --> 37:00.960
Che.

37:01.040 --> 37:01.920
Yan.

37:04.240 --> 37:05.080
Give it to me.

37:06.880 --> 37:09.240
Yan, this is the bread
you gave me yesterday.

37:09.320 --> 37:10.960
There are two pieces left.
I'll return them to you.

37:11.040 --> 37:12.880
Why not keep them for yourself?

37:12.960 --> 37:13.840
No need.

37:13.920 --> 37:15.880
I need to go to the palace
with them today.

37:15.960 --> 37:18.000
The foolish Emperor lied to us,
saying there would be a sacrifice,

37:18.080 --> 37:20.200
but he secretly left the palace
and is enjoying himself.

37:20.280 --> 37:22.680
We plan to gather the divine servants
and make the sacrifice immediately.

37:22.760 --> 37:24.720
I've heard that the palace
has enough water and food.

37:24.800 --> 37:27.120
We can bring some back
to relieve everyone's immediate suffering.

37:27.760 --> 37:29.520
Yan, do you want to come with us?

37:30.240 --> 37:31.440
Who is spreading these rumors?

37:31.520 --> 37:32.640
This is no rumor.

37:32.720 --> 37:34.680
The high-ranking officials
in the palace said it themselves.

37:35.200 --> 37:37.440
If we want to survive,
we can only rely on ourselves.

37:37.520 --> 37:40.680
If you want to join,
meet me in the palace later.

37:40.760 --> 37:41.800
I'm leaving now, Yan.

37:54.720 --> 37:56.720
If you're worried
about a palace rebellion,

37:56.800 --> 37:57.680
I'll go with you.

37:58.680 --> 38:01.560
You should stay here
and take care of your mother.

38:01.640 --> 38:02.520
Yan,

38:03.200 --> 38:05.640
Zhao Ming is not only your Saint Emperor,

38:05.720 --> 38:06.920
he is also my savior.

38:07.440 --> 38:09.440
If he hadn't solved the crisis for me,

38:09.520 --> 38:11.720
we'd have been separated long ago.
Isn't that right?

38:14.080 --> 38:16.080
The Soul Scattering Poison,
given by the Divine Clan.

38:16.680 --> 38:18.000
They wanted you to kill me?

38:19.480 --> 38:21.240
Why didn't you follow their order

38:22.080 --> 38:23.040
but chose to tell me instead?

38:23.720 --> 38:25.040
I'm not that righteous.

38:25.600 --> 38:27.120
I did indeed consider killing you.

38:28.200 --> 38:30.240
But even if I managed to kill you,

38:30.320 --> 38:32.760
this ruined life wouldn't end.

38:33.400 --> 38:34.600
For the rest of my life,

38:34.680 --> 38:36.760
I would be a puppet controlled by them.

38:38.440 --> 38:39.920
And my mother

38:41.200 --> 38:43.360
would suffer endless abuse,
never seeing hope again.

38:49.880 --> 38:53.240
I ask Your Majesty to exchange my life

38:53.760 --> 38:56.920
for my mother's safety and freedom.

39:02.080 --> 39:04.480
If you want to solve this situation,
you can.

39:06.080 --> 39:06.920
Just kill me.

39:08.840 --> 39:10.600
But do it at your birthday feast

39:11.320 --> 39:12.440
in front of everyone.

39:13.840 --> 39:15.520
Rising from the ashes,

39:18.800 --> 39:19.800
reborn like a phoenix.

39:19.880 --> 39:22.440
Zhao Ming has already told me everything.

39:22.520 --> 39:23.600
This is a Fireproof Stone.

39:24.200 --> 39:25.800
It will protect you from the flames.

39:26.680 --> 39:28.440
But after today,

39:28.960 --> 39:31.080
there will be no more
Princess Qingyang in this world.

39:31.160 --> 39:33.000
Princess Qingyang
should have died long ago.

39:33.600 --> 39:35.800
But I find
you're quite different from others.

39:35.880 --> 39:37.440
If there were more time,

39:38.280 --> 39:39.680
I would definitely be friends with you.

39:39.760 --> 39:41.640
If there is another chance,

39:41.720 --> 39:43.160
I'd like to get to know you again.

39:45.520 --> 39:47.320
I also have to thank Pearl.

39:47.400 --> 39:49.560
The blood of the Divine Saintess
can cure the divine poison.

39:50.720 --> 39:53.400
It was her blood that cured
the poison for me and my mother.

39:53.480 --> 39:54.640
She saved us.

40:01.040 --> 40:02.520
If we are to discuss gratitude,

40:02.600 --> 40:05.240
it should be that you stay, and I will go.

40:08.160 --> 40:10.840
All along, I could never outtalk you.

40:14.600 --> 40:16.680
You won't let me go. We agreed.

40:17.400 --> 40:19.000
No matter what happens,

40:19.760 --> 40:21.160
we will face it together.

40:24.960 --> 40:26.120
Alright.

40:29.560 --> 40:32.520
Respect the divine edict,
and overthrow Zhao Ming!

40:32.600 --> 40:35.640
Respect the divine edict,
and overthrow Zhao Ming!

40:35.720 --> 40:38.040
Respect the divine edict,
and overthrow Zhao Ming!

40:38.120 --> 40:41.960
Humans truly can't stand
the test of stirring up.

40:42.840 --> 40:44.720
I only arranged a few people,

40:44.800 --> 40:46.200
gave them a little push,

40:47.800 --> 40:49.120
and so many people joined.

40:50.000 --> 40:51.680
Truly foolish and laughable.

40:52.480 --> 40:54.880
Breaking his heart
with the people he cares for.

40:57.120 --> 40:58.120
Brilliant!

40:59.440 --> 41:02.640
I really want to see
Zhao Ming's expression

41:02.720 --> 41:06.000
when he faces the rebellion
of those he fought to protect.

41:06.080 --> 41:07.400
It's coming soon.

41:08.080 --> 41:09.400
Where are the people you arranged?

41:09.480 --> 41:12.520
Respect the divine edict,
and overthrow Zhao Ming!

41:12.600 --> 41:13.600
See?

41:13.680 --> 41:14.640
Just those two leaders.

41:15.320 --> 41:18.920
For a few bags of rice,
they sold their souls to me.

41:19.000 --> 41:21.560
Now they are no longer ordinary humans,

41:22.720 --> 41:24.680
but servants of me!

41:25.800 --> 41:28.360
As for dealing with Zhao Ming,
they likely stand no chance.

41:29.160 --> 41:30.880
But against ordinary humans,

41:31.480 --> 41:32.880
they're more than enough.

41:40.240 --> 41:41.120
Hand over the divine servants!

41:41.200 --> 41:43.640
-Where are the divine servants?
-Hand over the divine servants!

41:44.800 --> 41:45.640
Hand over the divine servants!

41:45.720 --> 41:47.560
You have disregarded
your agreement with His Majesty

41:47.640 --> 41:48.680
and barged into the palace.

41:48.760 --> 41:49.800
What are you trying to do?

41:49.880 --> 41:51.280
The sacrificial offering
was promised for tomorrow,

41:51.360 --> 41:52.680
but where is the foolish Emperor?

41:52.760 --> 41:55.000
He lied to us, but wants us to obey him?

41:55.080 --> 41:56.640
-Do you think we're fools?
-You…

41:56.720 --> 41:58.520
I'll hold them off here. Hurry and leave!

41:58.600 --> 41:59.600
I'll go find reinforcements.

41:59.680 --> 42:01.200
Find a way to get
to the divine servants' residence.

42:01.280 --> 42:03.120
-Protect the children.
-Be extra careful.

42:04.160 --> 42:05.960
She's the foolish Emperor's trusted one.

42:06.040 --> 42:07.200
She must know
where the divine servants are.

42:07.280 --> 42:08.120
Catch her!

42:08.200 --> 42:09.880
-Catch her!
-Catch her!

42:09.960 --> 42:11.520
Hand over the divine servants!

42:40.760 --> 42:41.840
See it now?

42:42.960 --> 42:44.760
This is human nature.

42:57.560 --> 42:59.080
Can you calm this rebellion?

42:59.680 --> 43:01.880
Divine artifacts cannot interfere
with human affairs.

43:04.040 --> 43:05.240
Then just watch here.

43:07.400 --> 43:08.560
You lost the bet.

43:10.680 --> 43:11.800
The third bet.

43:12.720 --> 43:14.360
Human nature is selfish.

43:14.440 --> 43:15.480
They repay kindness with hatred.

43:16.600 --> 43:19.640
According to the bet,
you should return with me.
